    "created_at": "2018-04-19T20:43:39Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-04-19T20:43:39Z",
    "body": "If we want this, I agree with @wanderview. I guess it'd be a new mode like `no-cors-same-origin`, which would allow more headers, but if request URL is/becomes cross-origin, downgrade to `cors` and filter the headers accordingly.",
