    "body": "> Oh, or do you mean that one would be able to rewrite request and set a new mode in a SW?\r\n\r\nYeah, that's what I was thinking. Changing the default mode or the behaviour of `no-cors` feels risky, and I'm not sure how we'd evaluate that risk.",
