    "created_at": "2018-04-19T22:42:14Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-04-19T22:42:14Z",
    "body": "Sounds good to me.\r\n\r\nAs long as there is a way to make such \"optimistic\" modifications to the request that will be guaranteed to never fail, but rather just be dropped on third-party redirects etc., everything else seems like an implementation detail.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
